{"unit_id":"XMoon__dsh-profile-settings#card-zh","repo":"XMoon/dsh-profile-settings","commit":"5bff86db924103666fb024a10442c8275bf7c7c0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"XMoon/dsh-profile-settings 是 DSH 的 profile 设置插件：它以分层 provider 接管 ctx.settings，将全局 settings.yaml 与每个 profile 的 settings.patch.yml 合并，并保留既有设置接口。用户可用命令或 Web 设置面板查看来源、修改覆盖值、屏蔽继承项、在全局与 profile 间迁移设置，并通过文件监视热重载配置。适合需要为不同 DSH profile 保存独立设置、同时共享全局默认值的用户；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:15-18","src/provider.ts:65-80","src/commands.ts:29-44","src/client/ProfileSettingsSection.tsx:101-123"]}
